      "text": "Headquarters (netsat.exe) Functionality – C2 Mechanism File Name: netsat.exe File Size: 43520 bytes Previous analysis results indicated netsat.exe retrieved commands from an encrypted file named netwn.drv resident in the CSIDL_WINDOWS\\msagent\\ directory.",
