      },
      "text": "Command Description cpd copies directories and contents cpr copies files with size checking der deletes files and records activity in log dir obtains a directory listing ferry writes malicious files to a hidden RECYCLED or RECYCLER directory Files: setup35.exe (renamed netui3.dll), Autorun.inf, ~disk.ini (renamed netwi.drv), act.te getres iteratively copies files from RECYCLED/RECYCLER directory on target drive, deletes from source after copy -­‐ source is assumed to be drive used to collect data from one or more systems netui3.dll (setup35.exe)",
